OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle crash causes town centre
OL,4,Agas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas leak that has led to several road
OL,7,Fclosures in Barnsley was caused by a
OL,8,Fvehicle crash, police have said.
OL,10,FThe single-vehicle collision, which
OL,11,Fhappened in Regent Street on Wednesday
OL,12,Fafternoon, left two people with minor
OL,13,Finjuries, according to South Yorkshire
OL,14,FPolice.
OL,16,FSouth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fcrews remained at the scene on
OL,18,FWednesday evening as work continued to
OL,19,Frepair a gas pipe damaged in the crash,
OL,20,Fwith Regent Street and Royal Street
OL,21,Fclosed to pedestrians and traffic.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
